<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Warner-Lambert raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Warner-Lambert raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded Warner-Lambert Co to outperform from neutral and set a 12-to-18 month price target on the stock of $110.</p>
<p>-- Said the move was based on increased sales potential for two new drugs: Lipitor for cholesterol reduction and Rezulin for Type II diabetes.</p>
<p>-- Said Warner-Lambert is likely to deliver the highest earnings per share growth rate among the major U.S. drug companies.  Raised EPS growth rate forecast to 20 percent from 14 percent.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/4 at 96-3/4.</p>
</text>
